Description: C++ library and application server for web applications [development]
 Wt is a web GUI library in modern C++. Quickly develop highly interactive
 web UIs with widgets, without having to write a single line of JavaScript.
 Wt handles all request handling and page rendering for you, so you can
 focus on functionality.
 .
 This package contains the headers and the CMake package (find_package(wt)).
